apex roughly matches depreciation (1.2x, 4.2% of sales), a maintenance pace.","Its Rule of 40 score is 6, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.0%), and institutions hold 73%.","It returns 6.5% a year to shareholders (0.9% in buybacks and 5.8% in dividends).","It pays out 126% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 460,000 employees, each generates about $193K of revenue, 0.5x the Industrials median, and revenue has grown 4.3% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $10K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $4.0M (21x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores poorly (8/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"INVEST","conv":76,"head":"Invest: trades 25% below fair value of $149; ROIC 21.9% vs WACC 8.1%.","pros":["Composite 46, above the 39 line (gates 12/25)","Trades 25% below fair value of $149","ROIC 21.9% vs WACC 8.1%","Altman Z in the safe zone","EV/EBITDA 9.7x vs sector 13.4x"],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":126.64,"vc":{"base":148.98,"base_src":"dcf","bear":116.47,"bull":194.1,"alt_median":127.75,"n_alt":3,"gap":0.1662,"dispersion":0.218,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":24.0501,"ev_ebitda":13.39,"pfcf":22.9066,"pb":2.9489,"roic":0.0996,"gross_margin":0.2855,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0143}},"mc_quantiles":[96.46,107.84,116.47,121.85,126.65,131.21,134.79,138.44,142.37,146.46,150.15,153.98,157.47,161.03,167.18,172.68,177.25,184.96,194.1,211.08,236.75],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.451,"discount_rate":0.402,"terminal_growth":0.04,"exit_multiple":0.107},"ticker":"UPS","date":"2026-11-13"}